      "comment": "Journeys list, under the \"Your journeys are in iCloud\" heading: what the deferred first sync will actually fetch. The placeholder is an already-formatted size, e.g. \"97.2 MB\". Says explicitly that originals are NOT part of this download — they stream when a photo is opened.",
      "localizations": {
        "nb": {
