          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Simulator can read host paths directly. For results that persist across launches and show photos, switch the store to %@ below, relaunch, then import. Re-importing preserves native edits — it only refreshes media paths and metadata.": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "The archive will contain only the route and the text": {
      "comment": "Export: accessibility hint on the include-photos toggle when it is off.",
      "localizations": {
